hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1346","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musalman kafir ka waris nahin banta, aur na kafir Musalman ka waris banta hai.'"
"1347","[AI-translation] Ali bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talib ke waris sirf Aqeel aur Talib bane the, Ali aur Ja'far waris nahin bane. Unhon ne kaha: Isi liye ham ne Shi'b mein apna hissa chhor diya."
"1348","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shu'aib se riwayat hai ke Banu Mudlij ke ek aadmi Qatadah ne apne bete ko mara ya talwar mari jo us ki pindli ko lagi to us ke zakhm se khoon bahta raha yahan tak ke woh faut ho gaya. Phir Suraqah bin Ju'sham Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur is ka zikr un se kiya. To Umar ne farmaya: Jab main tumhare paas aaun to Qudaid par ek sau bees oont taiyar rakhna. Phir jab Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) aae to unhon ne un oonton mein se tees hiqqa, tees jaza'a aur chalis hamila oontniyan lin, phir farmaya: Maqtool ka bhai kahan hai? Us ne kaha: Main yahan hun. Unhon ne farmaya: Inhen le lo, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qaatil ke liye kuch bhi nahin hai.'"
"1349","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab farmate the ke diyat aqila par hai, aur biwi apne shohar ki diyat se kisi cheez ki waris nahin hogi, yahan tak ke unhen Zahhak bin Sufyan ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki taraf likh bheja ke Ashyam Zibabi ki biwi ko us ki diyat se waris banao. To Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) is ki taraf ruju' kar gae."
"1350","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zahhak bin Sufyan ki taraf likha ke Ashyam Zibabi ki biwi ko us ki diyat se waris banao. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Ashyam ghalti se qatl hue the."
"1351","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Zubair se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha jo apni biwi ko talaq de aur use qata' kar de phir faut ho jae jabke woh aurat apni iddat mein ho. To Abdullah bin Zubair ne farmaya: Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne Tumazir bint Asbagh Kalbiyah ko talaq de kar qata' kar di, phir woh faut ho gae jabke woh aurat apni iddat mein thi to Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use waris banaya. Ibn Zubair ne farmaya: Rahi meri baat to main samajhta hun ke qata' ki hui aurat ko waris nahin banaya jaega."
"1352","[AI-translation] Talhah bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat hai aur woh is mamle ko sab se zyada janne wale the, aur Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne beemari mein apni biwi ko talaq batta di, to Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us ko un ke maal ka us ki iddat khatm hone ke baad waris banaya."
"1353","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Waris ke liye wasiyat nahin hai.'"
"1354","[AI-translation] Ata aur Tawus se riwayat hai ke un donon ne kaha: Wajib hajj asal maal se ada hoga."
